        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colona%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Here the Green River and the historic Hennepin Canal empty into the Rock River, a notable confluence in the region.",
