      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colona%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Colona is part of the Quad Cities metropolitan area, linking it culturally and economically to the larger regional community.",
